{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうも！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46   二期生   宮崎県出身\nまつりちゃんこと松田里奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobNrzss1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "綺良ちゃーーーん！！！\n卒業おめでとう🧡✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "綺良ちゃんらしい、綺良ちゃんにしかできない"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最高のセレモニーだったな〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな綺良ちゃんの唯一無二で、優しくて、思いやりがあって、面白くて、努力家なところ、本当に尊敬してます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん笑わせてくれてありがとう！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっぱい頑張ったね！！！\n本当にお疲れ様！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobQKdhgb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobLNnsH3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お家に遊び行く約束した♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobd0SFJc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobtf4yYK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "br